{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CsnS3tMZmwm7pq5fW25TGr","type":"tool_result","content":"1\timport Mathlib\n2\t\n3\topen Nat Topology Filter\n4\t\n5\t-- Note: uses (ℕ → ℝ) instead of (Fin (n + 1) → ℝ) and (ℝ → ℝ) instead of (tall ts → ℝ)\n6\tnoncomputable abbrev putnam_2023_b4_solution : ℝ := 29\n7\t/--\n8\tFor a nonnegative integer $n$ and a strictly increasing sequence of real numbers $t_0,t_1,\\dots,t_n$, let $f(t)$ be the corresponding real-valued function defined for $t \\geq t_0$ by the following properties:\n9\t\\begin{enumerate}\n10\t\\item[(a)] $f(t)$ is continuous for $t \\geq t_0$, and is twice differentiable for all $t>t_0$ other than $t_1,\\dots,t_n$;\n11\t\\item[(b)] $f(t_0)=1/2$;\n12\t\\item[(c)] $\\lim_{t \\to t_k^+} f'(t)=0$ for $0 \\leq k \\leq n$;\n13\t\\item[(d)] For $0 \\leq k \\leq n-1$, we have $f''(t)=k+1$ when $t_k< t< t_{k+1}$, and $f''(t)=n+1$ when $t>t_n$.\n14\t\\end{enumerate}\n15\tConsidering all choices of $n$ and $t_0,t_1,\\dots,t_n$ such that $t_k \\geq t_{k-1}+1$ for $1 \\leq k \\leq n$, what is the least possible value of $T$ for which $f(t_0+T)=2023$?\n16\t-/\n17\ttheorem putnam_2023_b4\n18\t    (tne : ℕ → (ℕ → ℝ) → Set ℝ)\n19\t    (htne : ∀ n ts, tne n ts = {t | t > ts 0 ∧ ∀ i : Fin n, t ≠ ts (i.1 + 1)}) :\n20\t    IsLeast\n21\t    {(T : ℝ) | 0 ≤ T ∧ ∃ (n : ℕ) (ts : ℕ → ℝ) (f : ℝ → ℝ),\n22\t      (∀ k : Fin n, ts (k.1 + 1) ≥ ts k.1 + 1) ∧\n23\t      ContinuousOn f (Set.Ici (ts 0)) ∧\n24\t      ContDiffOn ℝ 1 f (tne n ts) ∧\n25\t      DifferentiableOn ℝ (derivWithin f (tne n ts)) (tne n ts) ∧\n26\t      f (ts 0) = 0.5 ∧\n27\t      (∀ k : Fin (n + 1),\n28\t        Tendsto (derivWithin f (tne n ts)) (𝓝[>] (ts k.1)) (𝓝 0)) ∧\n29\t      (∀ k : Fin n,\n30\t        ∀ t ∈ Set.Ioo (ts k.1) (ts (k.1 + 1)),\n31\t          iteratedDerivWithin 2 f (tne n ts) t = k.1 + 1) ∧\n32\t      (∀ t > ts n,\n33\t        iteratedDerivWithin 2 f (tne n ts) t = n + 1) ∧\n34\t      f (ts 0 + T) = 2023}\n35\t    putnam_2023_b4_solution :=\n36\t  sorry\n37\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c9e8e366-895a-40d1-8ee2-22482531b289","uuid":"4031b2d9-3762-4923-8546-53bf553d2b81","timestamp":"2026-10-14T03:10:50.174Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/work/putnam_2023_b4.lean","content":"import Mathlib\n\nopen Nat Topology Filter\n\n-- Note: uses (ℕ → ℝ) instead of (Fin (n + 1) → ℝ) and (ℝ → ℝ) instead of (tall ts → ℝ)\nnoncomputable abbrev putnam_2023_b4_solution : ℝ := 29\n/--\nFor a nonnegative integer $n$ and a strictly increasing sequence of real numbers $t_0,t_1,\\dots,t_n$, let $f(t)$ be the corresponding real-valued function defined for $t \\geq t_0$ by the following properties:\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item[(a)] $f(t)$ is continuous for $t \\geq t_0$, and is twice differentiable for all $t>t_0$ other than $t_1,\\dots,t_n$;\n\\item[(b)] $f(t_0)=1/2$;\n\\item[(c)] $\\lim_{t \\to t_k^+} f'(t)=0$ for $0 \\leq k \\leq n$;\n\\item[(d)] For $0 \\leq k \\leq n-1$, we have $f''(t)=k+1$ when $t_k< t< t_{k+1}$, and $f''(t)=n+1$ when $t>t_n$.\n\\end{enumerate}\nConsidering all choices of $n$ and $t_0,t_1,\\dots,t_n$ such that $t_k \\geq t_{k-1}+1$ for $1 \\leq k \\leq n$, what is the least possible value of $T$ for which $f(t_0+T)=2023$?\n-/\ntheorem putnam_2023_b4\n    (tne : ℕ → (ℕ → ℝ) → Set ℝ)\n    (htne : ∀ n ts, tne n ts = {t | t > ts 0 ∧ ∀ i : Fin n, t ≠ ts (i.1 + 1)}) :\n    IsLeast\n    {(T : ℝ) | 0 ≤ T ∧ ∃ (n : ℕ) (ts : ℕ → ℝ) (f : ℝ → ℝ),\n      (∀ k : Fin n, ts (k.1 + 1) ≥ ts k.1 + 1) ∧\n      ContinuousOn f (Set.Ici (ts 0)) ∧\n      ContDiffOn ℝ 1 f (tne n ts) ∧\n      DifferentiableOn ℝ (derivWithin f (tne n ts)) (tne n ts) ∧\n      f (ts 0) = 0.5 ∧\n      (∀ k : Fin (n + 1),\n        Tendsto (derivWithin f (tne n ts)) (𝓝[>] (ts k.1)) (𝓝 0)) ∧\n      (∀ k : Fin n,\n        ∀ t ∈ Set.Ioo (ts k.1) (ts (k.1 + 1)),\n          iteratedDerivWithin 2 f (tne n ts) t = k.1 + 1) ∧\n      (∀ t > ts n,\n        iteratedDerivWithin 2 f (tne n ts) t = n + 1) ∧\n      f (ts 0 + T) = 2023}\n    putnam_2023_b4_solution :=\n  sorry\n","numLines":37,"startLine":1,"totalLines":37}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01CsnS3tMZmwm7pq5fW25TGr","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
